The self-built gesture dataset was collected using a Texas Instruments IWR1642 mmWave radar operating in the 278 76–81 GHz frequency band. 
The radar frame period was 33 ms, the range resolution was 0.039 m, the maximum unambiguous range was 2.41 m, and the radial velocity resolution was 0.13 m/s.

The public dataset contains 4600 valid gesture samples collected from four subjects with different ages and body heights. 
The self-built dataset contains 2100 valid gesture samples collected from three subjects. 
Both datasets include 12 hand gesture categories: arm to left (AL), arm to right (AR), hand away (HA), hand closer (HC), close fist horizontally (CFH), 
close fist perpendicularly (CFP), hand to right (HR), hand to left (HL), hand rotation palm down (HRPD), hand rotation palm up (HRPU), hand up (HU), 
and hand down (HD).

